<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Line of Death, 1986</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Line of Death, 1986&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Al “Beirutdude” Sandrik&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;The Time Is: 13 February 1983, 04:00 Zulu/5:00 Tripoli Time&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Eastern Mediterranean Sea&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Playable as USN&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;12 Hours Duration&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Background:&lt;/STRONG&gt; This scenario is inspired by the GDW Harpoon Game first scenario with much tweaking. Your Mission as the Commander of the USS Caron (DD 970) is to perform a Freedom of Navigation operation in the Gulf of Sidra for six (6) hours while coordinating support aircraft from the USS Coral Sea (CV 43) and P-3 aircraft from Sigonella, Italy. It is a very low complexity scenario with various threats. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Rule One&lt;/STRONG&gt;, National Command Authority wishes you do not initiate hostilities except in &lt;STRONG&gt;IMMINENT&lt;/STRONG&gt; self defense situation. In other words, no shooting down Libyan aircraft unless you have good reason to believe they are about to attack you.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;You will notice all of CVW-13 is not on the Coral Sea, yes that would totally unbalance the scenario, so just enough aircraft to balance things out.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Also notice you do not have control of the USS Coral Sea CVBG, &lt;EM&gt;&lt;U&gt;see the above&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;. If I gave control to the&amp;nbsp;player they&amp;nbsp;could just detach some or all of the escorts to support Caron. You have control of the aircraft on the Coral Sea but not the Battle Group.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;.INI and Delta Files are provided for deep rebuilds.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;Al “BeirutDude” Sandrik (ex-Beachinnole)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;Al.Sandrik@gmail.com&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Arial",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
  <Complexity>1</Complexity>
  <Difficulty>1</Difficulty>
  <ScenSetting>Gulf of Sidra</ScenSetting>
  <ScenDate>1986</ScenDate>
